OL,3,GNEWSAThameslink unveils 'blissful' new
OL,4,Aseats
OL,5,
OL,6,FThameslink has unveiled new seating it
OL,7,Fsays will mean "blissful journeys" for
OL,8,Fcommuters.
OL,10,FChief executive officer John Whitehurst
OL,11,Fsaid the existing "ironing board seats"
OL,12,Fwill be replaced by a "pocket-sprung
OL,13,Ffoam mattress wingback chair".
OL,15,F"They will be a lot springier," he
OL,16,Fsaid. "We've optimised the design to
OL,17,Fsupport your back, shoulders and head."
OL,19,FWhitehurst added the "memory foam
OL,20,Fapparently heats up as you sit on it -
OL,21,Fyou will sink into the chair and have a
OL,22,Fblissful journey."
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
